'''Raven Hill''' is an abandoned town located in western [[Duskwood]], north of [[Addle's Stead]] and south of the [[Raven Hill Cemetery]]. The village now holds only a few living people - [[Jitters]], and [[Bliztik]] the goblin vendor, who can be found hiding on the top floor of one of the buildings.

It is also haunted by the [[Unseen]].

